adaptation = "The formula is evaluated in the source-supported fq=None mode so OHLC and VWAP remain in the same unadjusted price units. The signal uses information through the T-day close and is evaluated against the standard T+1 open return. Normalization audit: Removed whitespace that split the second DELAY token. JoinQuant publishes the recurrence but not its server-side seed; the implementation uses the first valid observation as the seed and suppresses the first 156 close observations so the outer recursion receives 120 valid inputs."
tags = ["document", "alpha191", "daily"]
